 Patch 1: patch1  ┃ Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the
source lines quoted in the patches.

═════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES              *
═════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that
patch. A sign-less line with one
number is an edit both patches make:
a new number means both add it, an
old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f        ┃ old new│f
        │@@ line2 ┃        │@@ line4
        │rr       ┃        │dd
   2   2│line2 rr ┃        │
   3   3│line3 ss ┃        │
   4   4│line4 dd ┃   4   4│line4 dd
        │         ┃-  5    │line5 ee
        │         ┃+      5│P2_line5
        │         ┃   6   6│line6 ff
   5   5│line5 ee ┃   7   7│line5 ee
   6   6│line6 ff ┃   8   8│line6 ff
   7   7│line7 gg ┃-  9    │line7 gg
   8   8│line8 hh ┃        │
   9   9│line9 aa ┃        │
- 10    │line10 bb┃        │
+     10│P1_line10┃        │
  11  11│line11 cc┃        │

═════════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES            *
═════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only one
result: - patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│f        ┃     new│f
        │@@ line4 ┃        │@@ line4
        │dd       ┃        │dd
       4│line4 dd ┃       4│line4 dd
        │         ┃+      5│P2_line5
        │         ┃+      6│line6 ff
       5│line5 ee ┃       7│line5 ee
       6│line6 ff ┃       8│line6 ff
